    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i can just \"exist on my own terms\" here. there's no way out. if i try to change or be myself, everything falls apart. it's like i'm just waiting for a life that's never going to happen. it feels like the only way to actually have control over anything is to just... stop participating. to just exit the game entirely.",
